<title>MEXICO: Mexico 1995-96 coffee crop exports soar vs yr. ago.</title>
<headline>Mexico 1995-96 coffee crop exports soar vs yr. ago.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican coffee exports soared in the 1995-1996 cycle that has just ended to 4,578,327 60-kg bags compared to the 3,257,744 bags exported in the previous cycle, the Mexican Coffee Council said in a report obtained Monday.</p>
<p>Exports for September, the last month of the cycle, were 86,982 bags versus the 101,867 bags sent abroad in the same month a year earlier, the council said, giving no reasons for the surge in coffee placed on international markets.</p>
</text>
